        "text": "This principle of combining multiple analysis methods is called confluence, allowing traders to create a single strategy with the benefits of them all. Trading opportunities presented by the combined strategies could prove more robust than ones from a single strategy. Your trading style will ultimately dictate the mix you use and will depend on your risk profile and trading timeframe. It's also important to understand market trends and cycles when you invest and trade. We will learn how to read market trends and cycles in the next module.",
